      "reason": "Retain the English Wu alias at s0087, where Empress Yang is explicitly the consort of Wu, and retain Jin Wu in s0122. Remove only s0097 and s0106 from that alias: the complete Ningkang mourning debate identifies 博士吳商, whose existing p039 record already owns the named official and both evidence units."
    },
