      ],
      "after": [
        "claim:jinshu:020:c0231"
      ],
      "reason": "Retain Western Jin Wu in s0167 and Shizu in s0170 with all original chronology. Remove s0200 and s0206 from the Sima Yan/武帝 claim: both are explicit Eastern Jin 孝武帝太元 episodes already owned by existing Sima Yao p100. No wrongly associated Sima Yan alias is propagated onto p100."
    },
    {
      "kind": "claim",
      "before": [
        "claim:jinshu:020:c0413"
      ],
      "after": [
        "claim:jinshu:020:c0413"
      ],
      "reason": "Retain Jin Wu in the explicit 武帝泰始四年 s0404 and subsequent Jin mausoleum visitor s0436, including the original attestation. Remove 魏武帝建安 precedent s0368 from his name and reanchor the ruler role to explicit 武帝 at s0404, since existing Cao Cao p163 already owns the name and ruler role at s0368. The historical ruler role is unchanged; its wrong evidence unit is replaced by the existing explicit Jin name/attestation unit. This source correction requires independent review of changed role evidence."
    },
